// Neutral site templates (WM-010, WM-018), weakest first: world generation gives the sites nearest the starts the first
// and the farthest the last, so the value held and the guards rise with distance. Each names its hidden guardian
// faction (factions.json). "layout" is a prefab (FB-021: its blocks, the first core holding "items"); "guard" is a unit
// prefab (one core) spawned "guards" times beside the layout, holding its ground on defensive stance; "richness"
// multiplies the deposit patch the site guards (percent); "regional" lays that many cells of a regional item's deposit
// (RS-003, one the tile lacks first) around the layout at that richness. Strength (weapons' DPS x HP) and value (item tiers of costs
// and stock) are worked out from content and must rise from one template to the next. Values are placeholders.
